  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting and Operationalising the National Urban Sanitation Policy (NUSP) in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to create a coordination mechanism between the Ministry of Urban Development (MoUD)comma Government of India (GoI) and state and city governments for operationalising the National Urban Sanitation Policy (NUSP). This would be achieved by establishing an urban sanitation cell within MoUD to: (i) facilitate formulation of state sanitation strategies and city sanitation plans and their implementation; andcomma (ii) endeavour GoI to benchmark level of services and constitute clean city awards</narrative>
  </description>
